  "project_description": "Grouped product is an Arch submodule that links related products (e.g. size/colour variants) into a group and presents them as a switchable matrix on the product page. A GroupHandler tracks group membership, a ProductMatrix builds the option grid, and an AJAX API route swaps the displayed product when the shopper picks a variant. It ships a group widget, an IsGroupParent field, and matrix/default group field formatters.",
